WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:01.834
♪ (FUNKY MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:05.505
MICHAEL CHOW:<i> When I was young,
I wanted to become a painter.</i>

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:07.707
<i> I painted religiously.</i>

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.942
<i>But you learn very quickly...</i>

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:13.046
China, in the west,
was nothing.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.915
<i> They say, "No, you can't
 be a painter.</i>

00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:17.149
<i> You can't do anything."</i>

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:19.252
Except for restaurant
or laundry.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.853
So he said, "I'm not going to
do a laundry,

00:00:20.953 --> 00:00:22.222
I'm doing a restaurant."

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.726
SPEAKER:<i> He had to invent
 a whole new persona.</i>

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.029
SPEAKER 2:
<i> The name "Mr. Chow."</i>

00:00:30.229 --> 00:00:31.731
CHOW:<i> I wanted to
 create respect.</i>

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.432
<i> Respect for my country.</i>

00:00:33.532 --> 00:00:35.635
Because no one had called him
Mr. Chow.

00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:37.570
Chinese in low of low.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:40.406
<i> So I want to show them
 we are the chic of chic.</i>

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.373
This is theater.

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:44.744
We're looking for transcendence
to a higher place.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.713
The restaurant was crazy.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.150
SPEAKER 3:<i> All the Hollywood
 is there.</i>

00:00:52.117 --> 00:00:54.687
It was a safe place for
a lot of people.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:58.858
But Mr. Chow is a character,
created by him.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:01.760
<i>Of the man who doesn't want
 people to know</i>

00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:03.229
<i> who he really is.</i>

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:07.299
Give me black and white
with a stick, please.

00:01:07.566 --> 00:01:10.703
<i> My father was completely
 an artist.</i>

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.273
<i> Revolutionized the
 Beijing Opera.</i>

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:20.346
<i>He said to me, "Wherever you go,
 always remember,</i>

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:21.814
<i> you are Chinese."</i>

00:01:21.914 --> 00:01:22.882
Woo!

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:25.151
♪ (INSPIRING MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:27.554
<i> The problem with racism,
 it hurts.</i>

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:31.291
You take away my glasses
and take away my Rolls-Royce,

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:32.759
I'm not good enough now.

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:38.198
SPEAKER 4:<i> These paintings
 speak about turmoil.</i>

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:40.033
<i> About tension.</i>

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.469
But they're also
very joyous and free.

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:43.736
Woo!

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:46.806
SPEAKER 5:<i> Art and creativity
 is something</i>

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:48.707
<i>that is very important to him.</i>

00:01:49.575 --> 00:01:51.611
It's one of the things
that makes us human.

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:55.915
CHOW:<i> The most important
 thing about artists,</i>

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.718
<i>it's their job to be true
 to their time.</i>

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:02.355
<i> True to their dream.</i>

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:04.324
<i> And above all,</i>

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.595
<i> true to themselves.</i>

